# Bigspin: a 360 Shove-It (J + down, J again) with a backside 180 body turn (regular: turning right,
# clockwise, is backside) in the same air is one trick by name: Bigspin, in place of both entries. It
# lands fakie (the body turned half way round). It is a Bigspin by name from an eighth of the body's turn on.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+down 96
tap flip 99
hold right 101..140
run 320
expect event trickStart{trick=Bigspin} within 110..150
expect event trickEnd{trick=Bigspin} within 120..175
expect event land{fakie=true,quality=clean} within 160..240
expect event comboLanded{name=Bigspin,points=350} within 160..260
expect no event bail
